  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional strengthening and capacity building for child protection initiatives in Togo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This IDF aims at enabling the Directorate for the Protection and Promotion of the Family (within Ministry of Social Affairs) to carry out its mandate on social protection while developing partnership modalities between government and civil society through joint execution of child protection initiatives  Note: in view of the close links between this IDF and the on-going social fund pilot projet (P052263), the supervision of both of them will be carried in an integrated way.  Therefore, in spite of the fact that only a nominal amount of US$ 1.00 has been formally entered into SAP, part of the budget allocated for the social fund project  has been indeed earmarked for the IDF supervision (approximately US$ 10,000).</narrative>
  </description>
